  "properties": {
    "title": "Scripting with pyQGIS for beginners",
    "description": "Scripting is the power tool for any GIS user. It gives users the possibility to solve particular problems or automate long tasks. This workshop introduces pyQGIS to new users.\r\n\r\nThe workshop aims to give a first introduction to scripting in QGIS using its python scripting language pyQGIS.\r\nThe workshop will introduce the main python objects used to represent geometric and geographic objects, being it vector or raster.",
